:: Mine Escape
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>>
Not wanting to take the risk, you rush off into the tunnels. You run through the winding tunnels, trying to find an exit. 
As you emerge into a small cave, <span class="red">you realize you've already been here. You're lost!</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Escape Maze]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Escape Maze
<<effects>>
<<if !$mine.maze>>
	<<run V.mine.maze = new MineMaze(Object.values(V.NPCList));>>
	<<set _start_turn to 1>>
<<else>>
	<<run resetMazeMethods()>>
<</if>>

<<if $debug>>
	<<mine_maze_map>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<clearnpc>>
You are in a small cave. Various tunnels branch off.
<<if $mine.setup.dust gt 0 and $mine.maze.proximityCheck()>>
	You hear a <<= either("wheeze", "cough")>> from one of the tunnels.
<</if>>

<<if _start_turn and $mine.setup.lantern>>
	<br><br>
	You pull out the lantern, its flame flickers
	<<switch $mine.maze.lantern()>>
		<<case "up">>
			southwards
		<<case "down">>
			northwards
		<<case "left">>
			eastwards
		<<case "right">>
			westwards
	<</switch>>
	before going out.
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<run V.mine.maze.guardsWithPC()>>

<<if $mine.maze.ActiveGuards.length gte 1>>
	<<run V.mine.maze.setNPCSlots()>>

	<<person1>>

	You look around the cave and notice
	<<if $mine.maze.ActiveGuards.length gte 2>>
		some <<people>> standing by an entrance. They spot you, and rush you down.
	<<else>>
		a <<person>> standing by an entrance. <<He>> notices you, and rushes you down.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Escape Maze Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

	<<exit>>
<</if>>

<<if $mine.maze.PC.equals($mine.maze.Exit)>>
	<span class="blue">There's a ladder in the center of the cave, leading to the hole in the ceiling.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Climb the ladder|Mine Escape Victory]]>><<unset $mine.maze>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<if !_start_turn>>
	<<run V.mine.maze.moveGuards()>>
	<<run V.mine.maze.stun()>>
<</if>>

<<set _player_dir to $mine.maze.PC.possibleDirections(MineMaze.MAZE_SIZE)>>
<<if _player_dir.includes("up")>>
	<<link [[Move North|Mine Escape Maze]]>><<run V.mine.maze.PC.up()>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _player_dir.includes("down")>>
	<<link [[Move South|Mine Escape Maze]]>><<run V.mine.maze.PC.down()>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _player_dir.includes("left")>>
	<<link [[Move West|Mine Escape Maze]]>><<run V.mine.maze.PC.left()>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _player_dir.includes("right")>>
	<<link [[Move East|Mine Escape Maze]]>><<run V.mine.maze.PC.right()>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Stay where you are|Mine Escape Maze]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Escape Maze Fight
<<if $fightstart is 1>>
	<<set $fightstart to 0>>
	<<set $enemyno to $mine.maze.ActiveGuards.length>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<npcidlegenitals>>
	<<person1>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0) or $orgasmdown gte 1 or $worn.feet.type.includes("shackle")>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Escape Maze Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Escape Maze Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Escape Maze Fight Finish
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $orgasmdown gte 1>>
	<<shackle_feet>>
	Your spasms make it easy for <<him>> to restrain you. 
<<elseif $worn.feet.type.includes("shackle")>>
	Your shackles make it impossible for you to escape.
<<elseif $pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0>>
	<<shackle_feet>>
	Your body goes limp as you succumb to the pain. 
<<else>>
	<<if $mine.maze.ActiveGuards.length gte 2>>
		They fall
	<<else>>
		<<He>> falls
	<</if>>
	to the ground <<= $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax ? "in bliss" : "in pain">>. You waste no time as you rush into the tunnels.
	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Escape Maze]]>><<run
		V.mine.maze.combatEnd = MineMaze.prototype.combatEnd; 
		V.mine.maze.combatEnd();
	>><</link>>
	<<exit>>
<</if>>
<<He>> clamps shackles around your ankles. <<He>> chuckles, pulls you from the ground, and starts walking. 
<br><br>
You reach a more populated area, and <<he>><<endcombat>><<generate1>> passes you off to a <<person1>><<person>>. <<He>> drags you down a different tunnel.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><<unset $mine.maze>><</link>>



:: Mine Escape Victory
<<effects>><<earnFeat "Down Below">>
<<badEndTrackingEnd "Mines" { reason: "minesEscapedMaze" }>>

You hear shouting behind you. Three guards run your way. You grab onto the wooden ladder, and make it up just before it collapses beneath you.
<br><br>
You hear shouting below as you rush down the tunnel, stopping when you reach a fork. 
You catch a whiff of a foul stench from one of the them. It makes you queasy. You fight the urge to vomit, then stumble down the other tunnel.
<br><br>
You reach a steep incline. You climb the pitch black slope, the rock walls give way to cement, and you emerge in the storm drains. <<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Residential Drain]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
